###############################################################################
# Q11 -- Computational resources
###############################################################################

# The paper reports no training-cost or inference-cost figures.

###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Table 1 gives fitting errors on the training data per subset ('fitting errors of the constructed deep potentials'); they are all attributed to the final model. No separate test-set error was found in the text read.
# - The final training uses two million steps (800,000 during the iterations); the learning-rate schedule is stated for the 800,000-step runs. A hybrid se_e2_a + se_e3 descriptor was tested and not adopted (Supplementary Note 3).
# - Hydrogen diffusion coefficients against experiment, the site-occupancy analysis and the validation against DFT for migration energies are not encoded.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
